title Live link check: on a stand, pedalled at 63 rpm for 25 s, then still (virtual controller for bbs-link)

# Starts at level 3 so the check sees bbs-link set 0. Used by src/link/check.sh with ride_sim --serial: a real-time controller on
# a pseudo-terminal, for testing bbs-link without the bike.
bike pas_edge_error_deg 0.3
at 0 gear 2.0
at 0 level 3
at 2000 cadence 63 over 1000
at 25000 cadence 0

end 600000
